  <book xml:id="jc-science">
    <title>JC Science</title>
    <subtitle>Understand it. Use it. Think like a scientist.</subtitle>
    <frontmatter>
      <titlepage>
        <author><personname>Open JC Science Project</personname></author>
      </titlepage>
      <preface xml:id="how-to-use-this-book">
        <title>How to use this book</title>
        <p>This is not a printed textbook copied onto a screen. It is a learning system built around the Junior Cycle Science specification.</p>
        <p>Substantial ideas use three reading routes. <em>Read less</em> removes unnecessary reading load without removing the science. <em>Standard</em> gives the complete Junior Cycle explanation. <em>Go deeper</em> increases precision, mechanism, connection and transfer.</p>
        <p>Use retrieval questions before rereading. Attempt a prediction before revealing an explanation. Use hints as temporary supports, then return later without them. Practical work and Nature of Science are woven through every strand.</p>
      </preface>
    </frontmatter>

